  "type": "manhwa",
  "description": "Ryu Su-Ho has trouble falling asleep every night. The only voice on Channel \"J\" that helps him sleep disappears one day. His insomnia returns, and he stops by a convenience store hoping to finally fall asleep tonight. He hears \"J,\" the voice he thought he'd never hear again. He can't let go of the only person who can cure his terrible insomnia. In his haste, Su-Ho blurts out a few words to him...\n\n *\"...Mr. J, right?\"*\n\n(Source: Lezhin, translated)",
